Third-party components

This licence covers the vbx source in this repository. It does not cover the
dependencies vbx builds against, which carry their own licences — including
beads_viewer (github.com/Dicklesworthstone/beads_viewer), whose Go engine vbx
links, and the modules listed in Engine/bridge/go.mod. Their terms, not this
one, govern that code.
